:: OC Isaac Nightclub Event 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */

You stand outside of the redlight district lost in thought about what you saw before.<span style="color:Yellow"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaac</span> and his brother <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jacob</span> inside the district with a strange man.</span> You had pondered what it could mean, but until you were sure it wouldn’t leave your mind. <span style="color:Yellow">Plus, it couldn’t be what you thought it was… right?</span> <br>
<br>
You glance up near the entrance and see the bouncer, <span style="color:LightCoral">the very one who tossed you out last time.</span> He chuckles, smirking as he motions to the trash bin on the other side of the street. <span style="color:Pink">You blush as you remember the humiliating display of being tossed in there after your bottoms had been yanked off, leading to a humiliating display.</span> <br>

